The packaged executable is a byte-identical snapshot of the canonical original
runtime helper under scripts/setup/. source-provenance.json records its source
path and SHA256. check-sync.py must pass against that canonical source before
building or publishing a package from this repository.

No third-party template, service, font, compiled binary or platform component is
bundled. Optional configuration packages retain their separate package ownership.
Installing or removing this package does not activate or remove user configuration.
